WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.360
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Chinese action thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:19.840
called “Kung Fu Girl”. Watch out and take care!
Shanon is a martial art student living in Hong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:25.600
Kong. Her father Danny runs a local restaurant&nbsp;
during the day and develops games at night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.480
Shanon’s mother passed away a few years ago&nbsp;
while driving to an airport. Since her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:36.000
refused to drive her that day, Shanon blames him&nbsp;
for her mother’s death. The relationship between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.960
the father and daughter hasn’t been the same&nbsp;
ever since. Shanon lives in her school’s dorm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:46.400
and hardly ever visits home. She has a rivalry&nbsp;
with a guy from her class named Ricardo. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.440
and his group of friends bully her frequently.&nbsp;
One day, the bullies are in Shanon’s father’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.560
restaurant, complaining about the food not&nbsp;
being spicy enough. Even after devouring it all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.560 --> 00:01:01.600
they refuse to pay. Shanon retaliates&nbsp;
against them and forces them to pay up.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:07.440
A humiliated Ricardo throws the money to the floor&nbsp;
and walks away. Shanon picks it up and hands it to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:13.360
her father who is in a mascot costume. She also&nbsp;
apologizes to him for Ricardo’s rudeness.
&nbsp;

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.800
The next day at school, Ricardo takes his revenge&nbsp;
by making Shanon’s friend’s brother trip and drop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:23.680
his food. Shanon’s friends ask her to forget it&nbsp;
but she doesn’t want to let them off the hook.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:28.560
She sits with the group of bullies confidently&nbsp;
and eats from their plates. An intimidated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.320
Ricardo leaves her alone and walks away with his&nbsp;
friends. Later, Shanon finds out that he destroyed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:39.600
her clothes in the dryer. The group troubles&nbsp;
her every day, laughing when she messes up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:45.680
making her fall several times, and adding frogs&nbsp;
in her lunch box. A local shop owner hosts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:50.400
fighting matches in front of his house daily.&nbsp;
Shanon is informed that Ricardo has defeated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:55.200
everyone he has fought against till now. 
She takes the opportunity to challenge him in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:01.760
front of everyone. She even goes as far as to bet&nbsp;
him to wear a skirt if he loses. Ricardo, in turn,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:07.680
asks her to cut her hair and wear men’s clothes if&nbsp;
he wins. The fight starts and goes on for quite a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:13.760
while. However, it is evident that Ricardo is way&nbsp;
more skilled than Shanon. Suddenly, he catches her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:19.680
off guard and punches her in the stomach. The pain&nbsp;
almost causes Shanon to pass out. After the punch,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:25.680
she can hardly get up and is defeated in a single&nbsp;
kick. Ricardo laughs at her and hands her a pair&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:31.120
of scissors. Accepting her defeat, Shanon cuts&nbsp;
her hair. The next day, she goes to school with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:36.880
short hair and is made fun of by everyone. When&nbsp;
she enters the class, Ricardo calls her a man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:42.560
making her angrier than she already is. When he&nbsp;
doesn’t stop calling her names, she attacks him in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:47.440
the middle of the class. They have to be separated&nbsp;
by the teacher before a fight breaks out. 
&nbsp;

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:51.520
Shanon is then taken to the principal’s&nbsp;
office. He calls Danny to tell him about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:56.960
his daughter’s shenanigans. Danny apologizes for&nbsp;
the inconvenience, claiming that she is aggressive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:01.920
because he hasn’t been a good father to her.&nbsp;
He also begs the principal to let her free&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:05.680
this time. When Shanon goes to pick&nbsp;
up lunch from the cafeteria that day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:11.120
some girls block her. They have also joined hands&nbsp;
with Ricardo to trouble her around the school.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.200
Shanon’s friend yells at everyone for&nbsp;
supporting a bully but they ignore her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:19.520
Not wanting to cause a scene, Shanon&nbsp;
walks away without her lunch. 
 
&nbsp;

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:23.920
She reminisces about her mother who was&nbsp;
the reason she took interest in Kung fu.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:28.640
While most mothers dressed their daughters in&nbsp;
princess dresses, Shanon’s mother made her train&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:34.000
from a very young age. She believed that Kung&nbsp;
fu needed girls like Shanon as much as Shanon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:38.960
needed Kung fu. That night, Danny calls her&nbsp;
and asks her to come home for the weekend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:44.560
since she hasn’t been home in three months. Shanon&nbsp;
is reluctant but she agrees to visit him anyway.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:49.280
After the call with his daughter, Danny also&nbsp;
calls an investor and asks him to come over to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:55.280
test his new game. He has created a virtual game&nbsp;
where one has to fight in reality to win. 
&nbsp;

00:03:55.280 --> 00:04:00.400
At night, Shanon goes home and meets her father.&nbsp;
Danny tries to indulge her in a conversation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:05.600
but she is dismissive and rude. When called&nbsp;
out for being impolite, she forces a laugh&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:10.480
and ignores him. Danny also asks her about her&nbsp;
hair but Shanon dismisses it and doesn’t tell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:15.280
him about being bullied. When he brings up the&nbsp;
change in her behavior after her mother’s death,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:21.840
she blames him for all of it. Hurt by her words,&nbsp;
Danny walks away. Moments later, Shanon goes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:27.120
his home office and snoops around. She notices a&nbsp;
strange necklace on a table but doesn’t think much&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:32.960
of it. She also finds a headset on his workstation&nbsp;
and decides to wear it. As soon as she puts it on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:38.480
she enters the virtual world of ancient China.&nbsp;
All of a sudden, a group of people attack her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:43.760
but she defends herself efficiently. She also&nbsp;
notices that her hair is back to being long.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:49.280
Then, her eyes land on Ricardo who is dressed&nbsp;
in traditional Chinese clothing and is fighting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:53.920
the opponents. It turns out that the people&nbsp;
he is fighting are robbers trying to rob&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:59.040
food from a farmer’s house. Shanon is surprised&nbsp;
that Ricardo is doing a good thing for once. 
&nbsp;

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:04.000
Then, the leader of the group, Norman,&nbsp;
comes forward to fight Ricardo. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:08.960
he is proven to be weak against Ricardo’s&nbsp;
expertise and is knocked out within minutes. 
&nbsp;

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:13.360
After the thugs run away, Ricardo gives the&nbsp;
farmers the sacks of grains that were taken&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:18.560
away from them. Shanon follows him and asks him&nbsp;
how he got into the game. She soon finds out that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:24.240
he is part of the game with a different name and&nbsp;
an entirely different personality than Ricardo. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:29.840
also informs her of the powerful robber brothers,&nbsp;
Norman and Tyson. They have gathered and trained&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:35.520
an army to rob food and supplies from the poor.&nbsp;
Hence, Ricardo is protecting the people of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:40.800
town with his life. He is sure that since Norman&nbsp;
was just defeated, his short-tempered brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:47.280
Tyson will come to take revenge. Somewhere else in&nbsp;
the robber’s camp, Tyson is furious. He sends some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:52.080
of his people to keep an eye on Ricardo, looking&nbsp;
for the best time to strike the village. 
&nbsp;

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:56.400
Then, Shanon is shown around the village&nbsp;
and introduced to the martial arts academy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.400 --> 00:06:00.560
She meets her bully Daryl who is one of&nbsp;
the good guys in the virtual world.
&nbsp;

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:04.400
Her school’s principal is the martial arts&nbsp;
teacher. He assumes that she is with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:09.120
robbers and makes his pupils surround her.&nbsp;
On finding out that she is just an innocent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:14.320
foreigner, he apologizes and sends her to her&nbsp;
personal room for her stay in their village.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:19.520
Shanon is also introduced to the leader of&nbsp;
the village. Suddenly, Ricardo gets sick and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:24.720
falls unconscious. The group rushes them to the&nbsp;
village’s medic, Miss Aries. She is trained in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:30.320
martial arts and is a great warrior. Later, when&nbsp;
Ricardo gets better, she and Shanon explore the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:36.480
village. They come across an old shed and see a&nbsp;
gruesome-looking person meditating. Aries explains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:42.240
that the man is her father who has been in the&nbsp;
shed for a year. It turns out that her father, Bao&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:48.000
used to be a traveler who helped people and caught&nbsp;
robbers everywhere he went. However, after Aries’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:53.200
mother’s death, he wished to stay isolated from&nbsp;
the world and hasn’t come out of the shed. 
&nbsp;

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:57.520
Shanon stays in the village for the next few days&nbsp;
and learns different martial art techniques from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:02.560
the village’s head. She and Ricardo practice&nbsp;
together and learn many things from each other.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.880
Soon, the village runs out of food because&nbsp;
of the increase in robberies. The head of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:11.920
village reduces the daily three meals a day down&nbsp;
to only two meals. The workers and the civilians&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:18.000
are distressed because soon, they might die of&nbsp;
starvation. Hence, at night, Shanon, Ricardo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:24.240
Daryl, and Aries go to the robbers’ house to&nbsp;
steal grains. Daryl uses a tube and darts to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:29.360
make the guards unconscious. Then, they break into&nbsp;
the storage room and get ready to pack everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:35.040
in. However, the alarm rings, alerting everyone in&nbsp;
the house of their arrival. Aries comes in front&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:40.640
of the enemies to save the others. The rest of the&nbsp;
group has to reluctantly run away without her. 
&nbsp;

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:46.000
The next morning, Shanon asks the village head to&nbsp;
save Aries but he refuses to do so because Aries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:50.880
was caught stealing which is against their rule.&nbsp;
Following that, she goes to ask for help from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:55.920
Aries’s father Bao. She tells him everything about&nbsp;
her mother’s death and how she blamed her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.920 --> 00:08:00.640
for it. Shanon says that her father couldn’t be&nbsp;
nicer to her and admits that she was at fault for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:06.160
blaming him. She is about to lose hope when Bao&nbsp;
comes outside of the shed, determined to save his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:12.080
daughter. The group attacks the robber’s base and&nbsp;
fights the guard before rescuing Aries. The father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:17.200
and the daughter reunite and decide to go on a&nbsp;
trip like they used to. Shanon wants them to stay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:22.640
until the robbers are fully gone but Bao claims&nbsp;
he has faith that they can stop the robbers. 
&nbsp;

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:27.040
After Tyson finds out that his troops were&nbsp;
attacked, he gets ready to invade the village&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:31.520
with his soldiers. Knowing that he is about&nbsp;
to do something like that, Shanon, Ricardo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:36.640
and Daryl brainstorm ideas to stop him. Shanon&nbsp;
knows that there must be a way to defeat the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:42.720
enemy since this is a game after all. Then, she&nbsp;
remembers the necklace she saw on her father’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:47.920
table that matched exactly to the necklace&nbsp;
that a soldier was wearing. She happily thanks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:53.440
her father for the hint. Hours later, Tyson&nbsp;
along with his soldiers attacks the village.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:57.920
The village head and his pupils battle them&nbsp;
with all their might. Amidst the battle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:03.280
Shanon notices the necklace and the man wearing&nbsp;
it. However, while trying to fight him, she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:09.360
killed and brought back to reality. Shanon refuses&nbsp;
to lose and wears the headset again. It turns out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:14.560
that she has one more life left which means she&nbsp;
can continue the game from where she was earlier.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:19.520
This time, she beats the soldier and manages&nbsp;
to get his necklace. On opening the locket,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:23.920
she finds her mother’s picture inside.
In only a second, all of Tyson’s soldiers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:29.840
disappear because Shanon was able to figure out&nbsp;
the clue. When only Tyson is left, they overpower&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:35.440
him and win the battle. Following that, we see&nbsp;
Shanon and Ricardo by the side of the river.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:41.040
She tells him that she misses her father and asks&nbsp;
him to send her home. Ricardo promises to always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:46.160
remember her and sends her back to reality.&nbsp;
When Shanon is finally back it has only been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:50.880
a few hours since she started to play. It turns&nbsp;
out that Danny and a potential investor had been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:56.720
watching her play all this time. Shanon hugs&nbsp;
her father, apologizing for being rude to him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.720 --> 00:10:02.320
The investor is so impressed with the game that&nbsp;
he offers to invest ten million yuan in it.
&nbsp;

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:06.720
Next week is a national-level Kung fu&nbsp;
competition. Both Shanon and Ricardo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:11.600
have taken part in the competition and have been&nbsp;
selected in different divisions. They have to win&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:17.120
four rounds to reach the finals. On the day of the&nbsp;
competition, Shanon looks around and is sad that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:23.520
her father is not present. Still, she does her&nbsp;
best and wins easily against the real-life Aries.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:28.800
Similarly, Ricardo wins the next few rounds and&nbsp;
reaches the finals. Shanon goes against a guy in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:34.160
the semi-final and after an intense match, she&nbsp;
defeats him. Now, the rivals have to fight each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:39.440
other in the finals. The audience eagerly watches&nbsp;
as they get ready to fight. Ricardo strikes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:45.200
first attack but Shanon dodges it. Likewise,&nbsp;
Ricardo also dodges all of Shanon’s attacks. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:50.000
first round ends without any one of them getting&nbsp;
a proper hit. The referee blows the whistle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:55.360
indicating the end of the round but Ricardo&nbsp;
plays foul and attacks Shanon even after. 
&nbsp;

00:10:55.360 --> 00:11:00.720
His score is deducted but he doesn’t back down.&nbsp;
In the next round, they seem to match in skills&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:06.640
and strength. Suddenly, Shanon kicks Ricardo in&nbsp;
the back and makes him fall. An enraged Ricardo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:12.400
breaks the rules again and hits her on the back of&nbsp;
her knee. Shanon is in pain but she still gets up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:17.520
ready for the next round. This time, he kicks&nbsp;
her on the back of her head, breaking yet another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:23.520
rule. Shanon is almost knocked out but then, she&nbsp;
sees her father in a crab costume, cheering for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:29.040
her from the audience. With renewed motivation,&nbsp;
she stands up to fight Ricardo. She remembers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:34.160
the technique she had learned with the virtual&nbsp;
Ricardo and uses it on him. It works smoothly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:40.080
and she knocks him out to win the competition. As&nbsp;
the crowd erupts in cheers, she runs to her father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:45.760
and hugs him. In the last scene, she is back in&nbsp;
school. She makes amends with Ricardo who comments&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:50.320
that she deserved to win the last match. 
